  shops  where they end up             mean walk  best walk
      2  50, 51                             24.8       12.5
      3  48, 49, 49                         24.8        8.4
      5  30, 31, 47, 53, 54                 17.4        5.0

Two shops meet in the middle (Hotelling's minimum differentiation) and
the buyers walk about twice as far as they would if the shops were placed
to suit them.
